Google Antigravity CLI
======================

The optional subscription bridge image downloads Google's official Antigravity
CLI 1.2.4 from the versioned artifact recorded in
deploy/antigravity-bridge/agy.lock.json:

  https://storage.googleapis.com/antigravity-public/antigravity-cli/1.2.4-6085322963025920/linux-x64/cli_linux_x64.tar.gz
  SHA512: 5811d39ec1bf96a82ed06de6b8ee2bb7f5be8d74423b8c52b6b975e8f0e2c84c6cc2fa0baf902aad942c7566509c3ba6ddb5ef076260c6a635c4616e6ae17897

The upstream binary is distributed separately from the gateway source and
remains subject to its upstream terms. Documentation and product information:

  https://antigravity.google/docs/cli/install/
  https://antigravity.google/

The retired third-party Gemini CLI plugin is no longer included in this build.
